{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c3938a3fba113cb3","type":"text","text":"# Computer","x":-1080,"y":-220,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"274c6d25ee44e807","x":-500,"y":-365,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Laptop"},
		{"id":"1f73421890cc6b4e","type":"text","text":"### Desktop","x":-500,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8f6d7b206e04d30e","type":"text","text":"### WorkStation","x":-500,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"91c74919ad5a3931","type":"text","text":"### Server","x":-500,"y":-90,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"66df281375c81da2","x":-1080,"y":-425,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Sab ke pas screen hoti h lekin server ke pas nahi"},
		{"id":"6be02e4ca081c58c","x":-90,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Sustained performance at a fixed location."},
		{"id":"2cbe6f17b12e6620","x":-90,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Precision and reliability for professional tasks."},
		{"id":"6e6c4afebcabb7c2","x":-90,"y":-90,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Providing services to many users over a network."},
		{"id":"7611aca51ff200af","x":-90,"y":-365,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Portable everyday computing."},
		{"id":"19bea8fe37421a07","x":-860,"y":160,"width":1170,"height":233,"type":"text","text":"**We continue to find computers hiding in everyday objects:**\n\n|Type|What it is|Examples|\n|---|---|---|\n|**Smartphone**|Pocket-sized computer optimized for battery life and connectivity|iPhone, Android phone|\n|**Tablet**|Touch-first computer with larger screen|iPad, drawing tablet|\n|**IoT device**|Network-connected device with a single purpose|Thermostat, smart doorbell, fitness tracker|\n|**Embedded computer**|Computer built into another device|Coffee maker controller, automatic door sensor, lamp dimmer chip|"},
		{"id":"148aa3118a39da36","x":-860,"y":420,"width":732,"height":169,"type":"text","text":"|Computer Type|Screen and Keyboard|Main Purpose|\n|---|---|---|\n|Laptop|Yes|Portable everyday computing.|\n|Desktop|Yes|Sustained performance at a fixed location.|\n|Workstation|Yes|Precision and reliability for professional tasks.|\n|Server|No|Providing services to many users over a network.|"}
	],
